      "message": "I\u0027m not sure if I can agree with that.\nMy intention behind this test is to leave the implementation freedom of how the fan duty is increased.\nThe ramping is verified in the assert, i.e. if the implementation didn\u0027t ramp up the fan the fan_tick won\u0027t update the RPM.\n\nIn other words in this test case I only want to verify that the RPM reaches the target in a timely matter.",
