      "writtenOn": "2023-04-26T17:20:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not familiar enough with ztest, but can these sleeps be avoided, so we don\u0027t slow down the overall test time?\n\nIs there a way to fake the `ktimer` used by `board_override_fan_control_duty()`?",
      "revId": "c2ed0cbb30f294248592d0dd771802382774da09",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
