      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-26T20:08:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The sleeps in ztest don\u0027t actually take that real clock time, they just speed along the emulated system such that we give tasks what would be 1 second of run time (ex. so several HOOK_TICK iterations can run before our test code resumes)",
      "parentUuid": "02a13ea9_d369c7fb",
      "revId": "c2ed0cbb30f294248592d0dd771802382774da09",
