      "message": "```\nMy understanding is that rpm_target \u003d\u003d 0 doesn\u0027t mean it\u0027s stopped yet, just that we\u0027re intending for it to be stopped at some point.\n```\n\nCorrect.\n\n```\nSince this test is relying on fan_test_init() to reset the duty value, and fan_test_init() also resets rpm_target, this line should be removed for consistency.\n```\n\nI\u0027d actually prefer to leave it here for the sake of consistency.\nIn other tests the rpm_target is set explicitly to indicate how we want the state of the fan to be changed.",
